From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caio Oliveira <caio.oliveira@intel.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 19:50:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] spirv: Preserve all fp_math_ctrl bits in vtn_handle_alu
 default case

Fixes: a706769a0b3 ("nir: move exact bit to nir_fp_math_control")
Reviewed-by: Georg Lehmann <dadschoorse@gmail.com>
Reviewed-by: Mel Henning <mhenning@darkrefraction.com>
(cherry picked from commit 091a24e239b1269245852c82a1bcb586e965d6cc)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44489>
(cherry picked from commit 8f5125d15f3c125fd7eab54902fca4b3b26e9e85)
---
 src/compiler/spirv/vtn_alu.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/compiler/spirv/vtn_alu.c b/src/compiler/spirv/vtn_alu.c
index c17c3ca880f..d531d79877f 100644
--- a/src/compiler/spirv/vtn_alu.c
+++ b/src/compiler/spirv/vtn_alu.c
@@ -1135,7 +1135,7 @@ vtn_handle_alu(struct vtn_builder *b, SpvOp opcode,
          break;
       }
 
-      const bool save_fp_math_ctrl = b->nb.fp_math_ctrl;
+      const unsigned save_fp_math_ctrl = b->nb.fp_math_ctrl;
 
       b->nb.fp_math_ctrl |= extra_fp_math_ctrl;
 
